---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Me"
	description="Learn more about Locch and their journey"
	pubDate={new Date('January 24 2026')}
>
	<h2>Hi, there!</h2>
	
	<p>
		I'm a developer. I build things, and I write down what the building taught me.
		Don't expect polish here — expect honesty.
	</p>

	<p>
		I'm the founder of <a href="https://iteam1.github.io/iteam1/">iteam1</a> — a team
		that brings together many kinds of engineers, developers, and data scientists.
		Our projects live on <a href="https://github.com/iteam1">GitHub</a>.
	</p>

	<h3>What my head is usually full of</h3>
	<ul>
		<li>Machine learning and software engineering</li>
		<li>Building performant, user-friendly applications</li>
		<li>Exploring new technologies and programming paradigms</li>
		<li>Writing clean, maintainable code</li>
	</ul>

	<p>
		Off the keyboard: tech blogs, side projects, coffee.
	</p>

	<p>
		If you think a post is wrong, tell me. Being corrected is cheaper than staying
		wrong — that's half the reason I publish instead of keeping private notes.
	</p>
</Layout>
